      "worked_solution": "The mass of the triangular plate occupying the region ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/5914524b1d3db63c66998b75ca1d00a5dc4e294d2a8f10fe384d2b2ebf2af38e.svg) with mass density ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/eeea59e41716100d371e35f6a9cb2a2bd7a9285a7b849d8eac060daa0ba4d2be.svg) is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/7547107cd7e0b796f759b9f61151228a65276fdf9b1ee368f31527f5e88634ee.svg)\n\nNotice that ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/5914524b1d3db63c66998b75ca1d00a5dc4e294d2a8f10fe384d2b2ebf2af38e.svg) is a type I region. So, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/e92fc28ba8f4ba932b8a4596648cf1ad13b47180ee681caad1c72ede2c7fbc68.svg)\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/f4e3bd65ea5e543add33f4a03c10e6b51bba71ff45e1eee33a9ce7e01d064ac7.svg) treating ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/fcc5df999e3b49fae1685ee0ab5bd03709804e1dd49f2ee722c4269eb0f5506d.svg) as a constant:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/0bd607261ba1e95bff1b7d060d85791252208b530c096dcc2dca555f9a890b25.svg)\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/06d9e6ee04f202e0e861c51f0cd11ce47727f565d64d834fa625baea04ae11e6.svg)\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/59ac221987617d4c92321338b3646c155d483ede3f26614a615f6e3e49ff820f.svg)\n\nTherefore, the total mass of the plate is ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117153/assets/c06c6ac73c4cffd1c6d5f2e1a2a15e193ea80f6a97d595e2e6e9dd478261d2e6.svg)",
